Port 			2222
ListenAddress 		0.0.0.0
LoginGraceTime 		180
X11Forwarding 		yes
# App Service's portal SSH client requires one of aes128-cbc/3des-cbc/aes256-cbc and one of
# hmac-sha1/hmac-sha1-96, so those cannot be dropped entirely. Narrowed to the strongest
# permitted of each, with CTR/GCM and SHA-2 listed for clients that negotiate them.
Ciphers aes256-gcm@openssh.com,aes128-gcm@openssh.com,aes256-ctr,aes192-ctr,aes128-ctr,aes256-cbc
MACs hmac-sha2-512,hmac-sha2-256,hmac-sha1
StrictModes 		yes
SyslogFacility 		DAEMON
PasswordAuthentication 	yes
PermitEmptyPasswords 	no
PermitRootLogin 	yes
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
